    "description": "The Credit Card Application History API allows users to access historical records of credit card applications within the system. This endpoint provides a comprehensive list of applications, enabling consumers to track the status and details of past submissions effectively. Typical users include financial institutions, credit managers, and compliance officers who need to review application trends and identify patterns for risk assessment. By utilizing this API, organizations can enhance their decision-making processes regarding customer credit history and improve their service offerings.",
